{"data": [{"author_id": "1542705203320745985", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:09:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117000985914888259"], "id": "2117000985914888259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 294, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "こういう時在宅に出来るウチの会社\n融通が聞いて良い", "url": "https://x.com/minazuki_vrchat/status/2117000985914888259"}, {"author_id": "730317517210550272", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:36:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117234267134591452"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/EypAgKdCSJ", "end": 62, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/X_X_MAN_/status/2117234267134591452/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117219312889167872", "start": 39, "url": "https://t.co/EypAgKdCSJ"}]}, "id": "2117234267134591452", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 149, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不是怕你亏，是社融和险资都深度套里面了，不让它们出来的话，它们是真能造反的。 https://t.co/EypAgKdCSJ", "url": "https://x.com/X_X_MAN_/status/2117234267134591452"}, {"author_id": "823789739975114752", "created_at": "2026-11-01T10:35:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116841648726643003"], "id": "2116841648726643003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 16551, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说个暴论：\n现在AI模型发展已经到了瓶颈，A社融资规模从300亿减少到200亿\n\nAI发展进入去泡沫期，现在应该更多的是反思和沉淀\n\n理性的做法应该是探索下沉市场，而不是继续追风口", "url": "https://x.com/nieerai_dev/status/2116841648726643003"}, {"author_id": "1829889395916488704", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:31:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117052003608326165"], "id": "2117052003608326165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "本日の日経MJより。\n\n米粉製品数、5年で4倍／富澤商店、菓子作り用ミックス粉も\n\nUSMH、100店閉店のワケ／総菜改革へ4社融合／老いる店舗、投資回らず\n\n「エアリズムマスク」再販、レビューの力／ユニクロ、顧客の要望でサイズ・色も充実\n\n災害時「在宅避難を希望」72.5%", "url": "https://x.com/ichikawa_mk_lab/status/2117052003608326165"}, {"author_id": "1938063797098582019", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:36:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116781512628764972"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/WGiordanol66/s…", "end": 160, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116780651601076365", "start": 137, "url": "https://t.co/6w0Gtq4d8C"}]}, "id": "2116781512628764972", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 178, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116780651601076365", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "股市反映收入\n不制造收入\n主水管放在国债和社融\n汇金只负责别让撤离变成踩踏\n两万亿拿去充指数\n会把这两件事都做坏\n中国不是日本\n日本常年0息 还有美元可以错配\n日本央行无限弹药跟你不是一回事\n你把贝森特现在放在潘功胜的位置\n他也不可能给你干2w亿进去拉高股市\n换谁来都不会 https://t.co/6w0Gtq4d8C", "url": "https://x.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116781512628764972"}, {"author_id": "1938063797098582019", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:19:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116777208505413826"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/WGiordanol66/s…", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116775518070837451", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/gNMGLXLvqd"}]}, "id": "2116777208505413826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 177, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116775518070837451", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "人民币往股市里充值没用\n越充值越烂\n因为纯粹的是空转\n救市可以\n救市不是帮你解套是维护市场稳定跟有序撤离\n便宜了之后极度便宜一定有人会买\n外汇储备的账 谁都不清楚\n手里拿着美元还要稳定汇率还要买东西还要应对突发性事件\n中央汇金有多少笔钱一定是按审批预算扶持的\n主要还要靠非银跟社融还有债市 https://t.co/gNMGLXLvqd", "url": "https://x.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116777208505413826"}, {"author_id": "1938063797098582019", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:24:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116868911526469754"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/WGiordanol66/s…", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/WGiordanol66/status/2109613901319168465", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/HaQ1zWkf6k"}]}, "id": "2116868911526469754", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 485, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109613901319168465", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "其实最根本是第3条背后的那件事：\n中央用人民币把债发出去\n花成工资和国内订单\n社融和M2跟着这笔收入一起涨没有这一条\n回购\n外资\n离岸美元\n居民补仓\n都只是在换手\n有第三条这个推动器\n那些钱才是来确认的\n不是来当发动机的\n他们只是确认行情逐利的\n药引子还是第三条\n发动机不推🔥现在就是歇B over\n歇🔥 https://t.co/HaQ1zWkf6k", "url": "https://x.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116868911526469754"}, {"author_id": "1357355554096742400", "created_at": "2026-11-02T07:40:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117159939432984878"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LvTie0vodM", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Chapterr_11/status/2117159939432984878/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117159782259793921", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/LvTie0vodM"}]}, "id": "2117159939432984878", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's central bank just changed its policy playbook.\n\nThe PBOC formally shifted its main policy rate to the overnight rate at 1.25%, injecting ¥541B ($81.3B) through overnight reverse repos on Monday — replacing the long-standing 7-day benchmark at 1.40%.\n\nAnalysts call it a https://t.co/LvTie0vodM", "url": "https://x.com/Chapterr_11/status/2117159939432984878"}, {"author_id": "2081199803481133056", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:40:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117069290268655731"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZNYdv0VbSW", "end": 221, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/3m1sen/status/2117069290268655731/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117069257343442944", "start": 198, "url": "https://t.co/ZNYdv0VbSW"}]}, "id": "2117069290268655731", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_coun